{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act27side_level_act27side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act27side",
  "stageId": "act27side_05",
  "title": "我会唱一首彩虹",
  "storyCode": "SL-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "da6bccd115d3d6739b5ef87021ecf1e175c673193520a785f9fb00dcebf759d7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sunnytown_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "为什么要研究火山？\n我希望有一天，我可以在汐斯塔最高的地方弹吉他。不一定是在黑曜石音乐节上，最好是在火山上。\n我出的第一张专辑，就准备叫《火山奏鸣曲》。\n不能把火山叫醒？啊哈哈......那还是叫《火山安眠曲》吧。\n火山其实睡得很熟的，哪有那么容易被你叫醒。\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你有没有听说过，火山上的一种石头？\n风吹动它，会发出如同豆子落入碗中的响声。\n浸在水里，气泡又会咕嘟咕嘟地冒出来，就像细密的鼓点。\n当然是真的，如果我在哪座火山上找到了这种石头，我就把它带回来给你看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生已经来过了，今天感觉怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人躺在病床上，侧着头望向窗外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是你专门来提醒我在这个夏天只能躺在床上的话，还不错。而且，病床应该也比办公室的椅子要舒服些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢你还有精力调侃我，但这几天我的屁股就没有沾过椅子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许我们应该换换。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人回过头来，看向站在床边的自己的孙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么我的好孙子，今天来找我有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这份搬迁意向书，希望您能签个字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "市政厅职员像是认错一样低声吐出了这句话。\n然后便是一段疲惫又苦涩的沉默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来改建计划真的很着急，甚至等不到我咽气对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒不至于这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是觉得，总该让你知道这件事。当然，能取得你的同意是最好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是真的想说服我，至少该带着泰莎一起来看我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她也在工作......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是为了生活，对吧？真不明白，那样的女孩子为什么会同意嫁给你这样无聊的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就当我继承了您哄女孩开心的天赋吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "病房中安静下来，只有削水果的声音低低地响起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这几天，工作很辛苦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近总是莫名其妙做怪梦，想了想自己应该没得罪过什么人，所以我猜是你被不少人骂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您真聪明，对我的工作了解得真是一点不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你又是怎么想的呢？真的愿意让这片商业街拆掉，让老汐斯塔剩下的最后一点痕迹也消失不见？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科斯达，后面的柜子里放着一把吉他，拿出来给我弹一首吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了吧......您知道这样没有意义......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人不再说话，把头扭了过去，看向窗外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道，知更鸟咖啡店在汐斯塔的时间比市政厅还要长。还有那条街上许多家其他的店铺，从火山那里搬到这里的时候都留了下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但能让生活过不下去的困难太多了，火山甚至排不上号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咖啡和音乐只有在特定的时候才能养活人。如果不是我侥幸找到了市政厅的这份工作，您的医药费都会是这个家迈不过去的一道坎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是想抱怨什么，只是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得了，把笔给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科斯达，我讨厌你这个臭小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许我就应该在你用气泡水兑手冲咖啡的时候把你扔进海里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_997_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢您没真的这么做......我还是很喜欢您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g12_obsidianhotspringshotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想租用我的旅馆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你允许的范围内，对这里的温泉做一点小小的改造——价钱好商量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对钱不感兴趣，千篇一律，毫无美感！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，又不是只有钱才能作为交易的筹码，我这里绝对有你感兴趣的好东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如这个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这照片上是......那块展品级黑曜石？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把你管理的几家温泉旅馆租给我几天，我就把这块黑曜石搬到你这里怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别开玩笑了，这是私人博物馆里的贵重馆藏，怎么可能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩利佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_995_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说到做到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "口说无凭，咱们签个合同吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雪雉，研究一下，我说的那个方案能不能行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能......可行吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那就是能行！我相信你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不......！不是一定，我需要一些工具和材料......还需要一点......不，很多时间！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加油！我先去推进下一步了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然决定把重点放到让这条街的居民们欢迎我们的改造这一点上，那就要做到极致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜松用商品博览会这个招牌吸引到的游客，我们可不能浪费了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g8_siestavolcanomuseum_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不，不在......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（《火山爆发数据模型》绝对不在玛格娜教授留给阿黛尔的资料里。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（可为什么凯勒会有这本笔记......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辛苦了，要来杯咖啡吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不用，我不喝咖啡......阿黛尔今天不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天并不是工作日，你又在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "市政厅那边的工作需要这些旧文件吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯勒，你到底为什么要让阿黛尔来这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前应该说得很清楚了，这座博物馆的研究和瑙曼夫妇有关，并且汐斯塔的火山即将爆发，这是一次难得的观测机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛尔是他们的孩子，也是一个优秀的火山学者，我理应向她发出这次邀请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这么多年不联系之后的现在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌纳火山的意外后，你缺席了瑙曼夫妇的葬礼。你彻底从学界销声匿迹，从去年开始停止了学校的教职工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这几年里，你到底在做什么？你在逃避什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像你看到的，这几年我唯一做的事，就是整理现在已放在博物馆里的所有火山研究的资料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡恩，每个人的精力是有极限的。我已经没有力气再去火山上做考察了。等博物馆建好，等汐斯塔火山观测结束，我就准备要退休了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么......退休？你为什么还会想到“退休”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑙曼夫妇把所有未公开的研究资料留给你和阿黛尔，这些资源够你在学界扬名，你却说要在现在退休？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，你早就暗中为这些东西标好了价码，换到了更大的利益？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡恩，我不懂你在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯勒老师，您在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凯勒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论你有什么打算，我希望你做任何决定之前能想一想瑙曼老师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛尔是他们唯一的孩子，也是他们留下来的唯一希望。而她已经感染了矿石病，甚至如今的病情并不乐观......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_996_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我希望她是快乐和自由的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯勒老师？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我在，阿黛尔。进来吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯勒老师，我找回了那件展品，已经放回展示柜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......辛苦你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老师，您怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......没什么。\n展品是从哪里找到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是被偷偷溜进博物馆的循兽叼走的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那没什么事的话你先——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯勒老师，还有一件事......！我在商业街遇到一位店主先生。他让我把这本书还给您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商业街的一位店主先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g3_siestanewstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1014_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1014_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在空气里尝到了疲劳的味道，苦苦的，酸酸的，是从谁身上传出来的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多利先生！吓我一跳，你怎么在这里呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1014_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛尔，我刚刚在城市那头看到了一抹漂亮的蓝色，你想不想去泡温泉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多利先生，我还有研究要做......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1014_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，“研究”这两个字苦到都有点皱巴巴的了，火山就在那里，资料也不会消失，你随时都可以回来做研究，但——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "多利轻轻一踮脚，在半空中旋转起来，看起来是在跳一支有些滑稽的舞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1014_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些事情可是转瞬即逝，一旦错过就不会再有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1014_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小艾雅——终于找到你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，要不要一起去泡温泉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡温泉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可没有操控人心的本领哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_180_amgoat_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是什么？你没有带泳衣？没事，我那里有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了你和我，还有雪雉，我们待会儿去把锡兰小姐也叫上，我还买了最新款的面霜——据说添加了火山灰成分哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我还有一件很重要的事拜托你，只有你能做到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......哥伦比亚的最新款唱片机？居然能在汐斯塔见到......！我可是自己有在特殊关注，才知道它是几天前才发售的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这已经是卖剩下的了，你错过了第一波......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不知道，这边早上排了特别长的队，大帝签名的限量版唱片机还会附赠最新专辑，那一批早都全部售完了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大帝的最新专辑？！我记得不是还有一周才正式发售吗！这叫什么，拿到了提前批？主办方是什么来头啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不光是大帝的专辑！这边还有空小姐的签名专辑、卡西米尔耀骑士的头盔模型、《车尔尼钢琴曲集》！......等等，这是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，居然在这里也能看到我们萨尔贡的蟹蟹抽水泵啊......但是，这东西在汐斯塔这里究竟有什么用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管他呢，可爱就行了！没看到很多人都在排队买吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，这里还有椰枣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_993_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "椰枣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_993_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打扰了，这位来自萨尔贡的先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伯德信手弹起一段萨尔贡风情的小调。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_993_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以给我讲讲，在干热的熏风中采收椰枣的故事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乐器店老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是从莱塔尼亚运来的乐器，不得不说，莱塔尼亚人在音乐相关的东西上是有一手的。喜欢可以上手试试，有什么不会的我可以来教您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乐器店老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我刚才弹的这首曲子？是我和我老婆表白时候弹的，嘿嘿。您喜欢的话，我这还有谱子，可以拿去学学啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乐器店老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您问哪家零食好吃？左手边那个胡子老爷爷有看到吗？他家的冰淇淋最好啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢慢来慢慢来，你是草莓你是橘子你是咖啡，还有什么来着？椰子味拼巧克力？哎呦......不要急，都会有的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板，给我来一个红茶味的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，马上就来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个也发给黑看一下......馋馋她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锡兰医生！您也来博览会啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天正好有空，我就顺便逛逛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃尼斯，好小子！得亏今早有你帮我修好了收款机，要不然我真的就忙不过来咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，顺手帮个忙而已！您生意怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好得很，差点以为我还在之前的汐斯塔呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但怎么没见科斯达那个小子？整天为了这个会跑前跑后，真开起来了他人又不见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能今天市政厅还有别的工作吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这小子，连翘个班都不会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板，来个冰淇淋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来咯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也欢迎各位来我们纯白火山尝尝鸡尾酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "埃尼斯靠在冷饮柜上，看着周围人来人往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们刚刚看到我弟弟和妹妹了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们第一次见到这么热闹的地方，一路上吵着要喝什么火山咖啡，我刚把零花钱给他们，一转眼连人带钱全都跑没影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我刚才在这里没看到有小孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小孩子肯定不在这里，要找他们，你要往东街那边走走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷饮店店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1002_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那边说是有什么新落成的游乐场，我家臭小子吃早饭的时候还说帮我看店，哼，听到有游乐场之后我就再没看到过他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......游乐场？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g12_obsidianhotspringshotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诗怀雅小姐，我现在能睁眼了吗？你说有很重要的事情到底是什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是温泉旅馆也出现了那些最近偷偷开采的黑曜石吗？还是你的工作需要一名火山研究者挂名？还是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都不是啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里没有火山、没有数据，只有一汪会让人很舒服的温泉，你现在只需要穿着好看的衣服，然后——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你现在可以睁眼了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇......好多游客啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里怎么全变样了？之前不还是一片温泉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真热闹，好像几年前的汐斯塔啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几声游客的欢呼传来，阿黛尔从惊讶中回过神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么多皮划艇和水上设施，诗怀雅小姐，这些是你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是我为商业街准备的水上乐园！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇......这些全都是诗怀雅小姐做的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我一个人的功劳啦，除了我提供的方案以外，它的落地和实现多亏了我们龙门的首席天才工程师，雪雉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜！诗、诗怀雅小姐......这个称号太夸张了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炎国第一，泰拉第一天才工程师雪雉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下，雪雉小姐，不要乱跑啊，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢噢噢——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客惊呼声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "飞、飞起来了——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这是怎么做到的？这些冲浪皮艇居然会从一个温泉水道直接飞到另一个温泉水道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，没有看起来那么复杂啦，只需要在水道中添加一个气动弹射装置，皮艇开到这里，就会触发机关，然后它就会——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客惊呼声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耶！我会飞了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客惊呼声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，水道旁边也没有护栏，我有点担心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根据诗怀雅小姐说的，我重新设计了皮艇，给它装配了全方位的应急缓震系统。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是冲浪皮艇的第二种玩法，碰碰皮艇！游客可以在水道中自由碰撞，减震系统会吸收掉所有冲击力，化成皮艇水枪里喷向对面的水花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我没有说，但是不少游客好像已经掌握了这个诀窍呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看那边——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小游客欢呼声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伴随着一阵尖叫声，一艘皮艇在水道中一个旋转，眼看就要掉下来了。\n皮艇边缘迅速膨胀起气囊，将乘坐者包裹在中心，但下落的弧线却突然中断，仿佛空气中存在着什么透明的屏障一样。\n水花溅落在地上，被完全包裹着的皮艇这才晃晃悠悠，向下跌去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——你们怎么样！有没有受伤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍等我一下，小艾雅，我先过去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "街上的游客都围了上去，皮艇中却传来了咯咯的笑声。\n随着鼓囊囊的气垫一阵鼓动，两个小孩从里面钻了出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不开心的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，都怪你乱动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不开心的小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小毛羊也没抓到，我们的“汐斯塔探险”计划还泡汤了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "很开心的小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "才不是因为我呢！是小毛羊的速度太快啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小毛羊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里也没有看到......平时你照顾弟弟妹妹也很辛苦吧？这个年纪的小孩子都很爱玩爱闹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，谢谢关心，不过这样也挺好的，起码他们过得是真的快乐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做哥哥的确实会操心很多事情啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1003_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回想起了一些自己之前的事情......噗，总感觉有位朋友偶尔也会这么想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锡兰医生有位兄长或是姐姐吗？我还从来没有听说过——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都怪你！都怪你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！两个小家伙！你们跑哪里去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃尼斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是埃尼斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩&小女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们坐着大气垫船，去追小毛羊了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们说什么呢？什么毛羊......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是那种会顶我们的船，还把我们的船顶翻了当皮球踢的小毛羊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我们追到它，一定要让它坐我们的船！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃尼斯，快看，小毛羊又回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抬头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4106_bryota_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们家的冲浪板......怎么都在天上飞啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "冲浪板、游泳圈。\n乘着温泉蒸汽跃起，跨越风情街上空，跨越游客们的视线。\n所有人都目不转睛地看着这些物品如同活物一般地旋动身子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而在阿黛尔的眼中，与其他人略有区别。\n那些从天上飘过去的冲浪板，上面站着几只小羊。\n它们似乎并不满足于仅在水道之中竞速——\n热水、雾气、五颜六色的冲浪板和游泳圈，被小羊们裹挟着，一同涌入风情街的热闹之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这......太糟糕了！多利先生每次都说会教训它们，是不是都是在骗我？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（天哪，它们把温泉水洒得到处都是！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......雪雉，是因为我否定了你摩天轮悬空温泉的点子，所以你背着我偷偷设计了飞行冲浪板吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没、没有啊......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个不是诗怀雅小姐你秘密安排的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也不是我啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两人对视了一眼，然后迟疑着将目光看向一直站在一旁的阿黛尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1005_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿黛尔小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不！也不是我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪了，难道是拜松？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_992_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呦呼——小毛羊，小毛羊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_991_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小毛羊飞上天啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜啊——小艾雅，雪雉——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_1033_swire2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些冲浪板真的会飞！先别管了，快上冲浪板一起玩吧——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板是谁？量产，快量产这种冲浪板！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游客B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呦呼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，多利先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_989_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是你说的泡温泉吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
